   "label": "U23 pins 7 and 12 (zero crossing detector outputs)",
   "component": "U23",
   "refPoint": "TP1",
   "source": "§5-18 step 11a",
   "note": "The two LM319 comparators that square up the oscillator signal (SUMMING AMP OUT or INT OSC OUT, selected by Q7) and the external reference from TP9. Both outputs must be square waves; the step gives no level or duty cycle, only that the sine inputs are converted. Pin 12 is U23A (the oscillator side), pin 7 is U23B (the reference side).",
